<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 6.699 percent on Portugal 10-yr bonds. [CORRECTED 12:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Yield 6.699 percent on Portugal 10-yr bonds. [CORRECTED 12:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline by removing reference to the yield rising.)</p>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management auction of 10-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:Feb 2007</p>
<p>    AMOUNT PLACED: 6.8 billion escudos    COUPON:6.625</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.699368</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 6.71  LOWEST: 6.67</p>
<p>    BIDS: 72.93 billion   PAYMENT FREQUENCY:Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 56.95 billion the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
